• Experience developing complex custom workflows on O365 with Power Apps and Power Automate;

• Experience in SharePoint site page customizations with JSON and CSS;

• Experience with PowerBI;

• Experience with Azure integrations;

• Fluent in English;

Offered:

• A challenging role for an international organization;

